  "Skip line hover msg": "This item is set when the column name does not exist in the first row. You can enter a value between 0 and 100. \nIf nothing is entered, the data will be loaded using the first row as column names. \nIf 0, column names will be automatically generated. Also, if nothing is entered and there are many numbers in the first line, 0 will be entered automatically. \nIf it is 1 or more, the data will be skipped to the row number of the entered value, and the data will be read using the next row as the column name.",
