  "ConfigWebHoverMsg": "Get data using HTTP GET.\nReturned data must be in JSON array of objects format, for example:\n[\n    {&quot;datetime&quot;: &quot;2025-01-01T00:00:00&quot;, &quot;serial_no&quot;: &quot;ABC0001&quot;, &quot;temperature&quot;: 12.3},\n    {&quot;datetime&quot;: &quot;2025-01-01T00:01:00&quot;, &quot;serial_no&quot;: &quot;ABC0002&quot;, &quot;temperature&quot;: 14.1},\n    {&quot;datetime&quot;: &quot;2025-01-01T00:02:00&quot;, &quot;serial_no&quot;: &quot;ABC0003&quot;, &quot;temperature&quot;: 11.2}\n]",
  "ImportLimitTitle": "Limits the number of rows to import.\nThe limit applies to each process (e.g., for a database: table, for CSV: folder).\nIf you decrease the limit or when importing the latest data, if the number of rows exceeds the limit,\nthe oldest data will be deleted from database in AP+DN7.\nWhen the import limit is increased, the data previously imported into AP+DN7 is first deleted and then re-imported from the data sources.",
