  "ExportSubfolderTooltipText": "Files are automatically exported into\nsubfolders created based on the selected time unit.\n\nExamples:\nDaily: 20260101\nWeekly: 2026-W01 (ISO week number)\nMonthly: 2026-01",
  "ExportFileSplitTooltipText": "Prevents creating oversized files.\nIf the row limit or 100MB size is exceeded,\nthe output is split into multiple files.\n\nSplit files are numbered (e.g., dat_1.csv, dat_2.csv).",
